Redface 2 v0.37.0 — beta.

- The topic view has been redesigned: page changes no longer flash, quote jumps return precisely, reading markers are clearer, and posts can use the full width.
- Pinch the page to zoom up to 3×.
- Images fit their content and screen better; thumbnails and GIFs are easier to read, with actions, clear errors, and retry.
- Replying and quoting are smoother — full screen (with image upload) or the experimental quick reply.
